{"id":391,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p>为弘扬勤俭节约的传统美德，践行绿色低碳的环保理念，推进校园资源循环利用，6月8日至10日，经济管理学院团委顺利开展“毕业季|旧衣回收”活动。本次活动聚焦毕业季校园闲置资源处理问题，以青春公益助力绿色校园建设，具有深刻的育人价值与环保意义。</p><p>活动期间，学院团委统筹组织、周密安排，招募学生志愿者投入本次公益服务。志愿者们有序开展旧衣收集工作，认真接收同学们捐赠的闲置衣物，并在每日晚间统一整理、集中运送，保障整个回收流程规范高效、井然有序。</p><p>本次旧衣回收活动充分彰显了新时代大学生勤俭节约、乐于奉献的优良品质。同时，志愿服务的开展让青年学生在实践中锻炼自我、提升自我，深刻体悟志愿服务精神，进一步增强了青年的责任意识与公益意识。活动以微小的青春行动汇聚环保力量，丰富了毕业季校园文明建设内容，充分展现了经济管理学院学子积极向上、热心公益的青春风貌。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=OMNlx4LRUDnzVVUJ8CDL8L4o7Cinl70YMlnfUzMVozCsLR70gihFp2hmCIa0nkh2UYyZoSyZnRNZnmvioRW2L8LZnRf2oznRnml8MmL8UzWFM87bnzlaL7rFL4NZMRUJv2bjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRL4g4-8MRGbgtA8pUacc&oid=1280026481&tid=1033&nid=24409&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/DFC898D98F7582F3C8D0F94CF54634A2/7A9E500E/39844\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"416\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=OMNlx4LRUDnzVVUJ8CDL8L4o7Cinl70YMlnfUzMVozCsLR70gihFp2hmCIa0nkh2UYyZoSyZnRNZnmvioRW2L8LZnRf2oznRnml8MmL8UzWFM87bnzlaL7rFL4NZMRUJv2bjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRL4g4-8MRGbgtA8pUacc&oid=1280026481&tid=1033&nid=24409&e=.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=OnR6xfnzWVM8CDLJz-PLz-PMzr7MNU08nRvDU474LzLYLNl0gihFp2hmCIa0LkhVLkhVLSy8olCaLRNanmLaMlLYoR7Dnz7bMz67UNCDMzrFL7-iM7V2nR6FL4TRnRvJv2bjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRL4g4-8MRGbgtA8pUacc&oid=1280026481&tid=1033&nid=24409&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/0E0E149F0090F305C2816E1957DBF655/0B54AFD7/39CD7\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"411\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=OnR6xfnzWVM8CDLJz-PLz-PMzr7MNU08nRvDU474LzLYLNl0gihFp2hmCIa0LkhVLkhVLSy8olCaLRNanmLaMlLYoR7Dnz7bMz67UNCDMzrFL7-iM7V2nR6FL4TRnRvJv2bjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRL4g4-8MRGbgtA8pUacc&oid=1280026481&tid=1033&nid=24409&e=.png\"></p><p><br></p></div></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://jgy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=OMNlx4LRUDnzVVUJ8CDL8L4o7Cinl70YMlnfUzMVozCsLR70gihFp2hmCIa0nkh2UYyZoSyZnRNZnmvioRW2L8LZnRf2oznRnml8MmL8UzWFM87bnzlaL7rFL4NZMRUJv2bjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRL4g4-8MRGbgtA8p